The Commission may conduct the following types of meetings, namely.
(i) ordinary meetings relating to a statutory inquiry or investigation, or other proceedings, subject to the provisions of the
Act, or the rules or regulations made thereunder;
(ii) special meeting relating to all other functions not covered by the ordinary meeting;
(iii) emergency meeting in case of emergent issue to be decided by circulation.

27.
Powers and duties of Secretary.
(1) The power and duties of the Secretary shall be the following, namely:
(a) the Secretary shall have the custody of records of the Commission and shall exercise such other functions as may
be assigned to him by the Commission;
(b) the Secretary shall circulate to all concerned, the date, time and place of each meeting, as per the directions of the
